Source: omaxian-fonts-nerd
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Marcello Palmitessa <marcello@omaxian.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://www.nerdfonts.com/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: omaxian-fonts-nerd
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig
Provides: fonts-jetbrains-mono-nerd
Description: JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (Omaxian default monospace)
 JetBrains Mono patched with the Nerd Fonts glyph sets (Powerline, Font
 Awesome, Material Design, Codicons, Devicons, Octicons, ...), as used by the
 Omaxian session (kitty, alacritty, ghostty, i3 bar, dunst, Quickshell).
 .
 This package ships the official Nerd Fonts release archive JetBrainsMono.tar.xz
 (version pinned and SHA-256-verified at build time): the "JetBrainsMono Nerd
 Font" and "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono" families, installed system-wide in
 /usr/share/fonts/truetype/jetbrains-mono-nerd. It also makes JetBrains Mono
 Nerd Font the preferred fontconfig "monospace" family.
